personality = "gentle"
description = "Mossbun's Awakened Form: long, low and careful. Overlapping bark shingles armour its back under a living mat of moss and ferns, short forked boughs grow from its shoulders, and its long three-fingered root hands grip bark and stone."
personality_text = "Patient and watchful. Mossmantle climbs onto rocks to look around, sniffs every root, and settles down to let moss grow on whatever it rests against."
